  "description": "CIKFIO crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C68 H74 Dy4 N10 O24,2(C3 H7 N1 O1),H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.493-3.971 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.67-113.10°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(L)4(OH)2(DMF)4(NO3)2]·2DMF·H2O.",
